<title>FRANCE: S&amp;P rates debt of Axa and UAP at &quot;AA-&quot; post-merger.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates debt of Axa and UAP at &quot;AA-&quot; post-merger.</headline>
<text>
<p>PARIS, May 28 (reuter) - Standard and Poor's said on Wednesday it had assigned an &quot;AA minus&quot; rating to the debt of French insurers Axa and UAP following their merger.</p>
</text>
